    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41975" root="وشر" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُوتَشِرَةٌ</span></b>  A woman <i>who orders one to sharpen
teeth and to make them thin</i> [<i>and serrated</i>]:
(L:) or <i>who asks for this to be done;</i> as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْتَوْشِرَةٌ</span></b> : (K:) if with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span>, it is from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْرٌ</span>, not
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَشْرٌ</span>; and if without <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span>, accord. to the regular
way it should be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَّشِرَةٌ</span>. (K.)

